ype":"question","prompt":"某河道由于淤泥堆积影响到船只航行安全，现由工程队使用挖沙机进行清淤工作，清淤时上游河水又会带来新的泥沙。若使用 1 台挖沙机 300 天可完成清淤工作，使用 2 台挖沙机 100 天可完成清淤工作。为了尽快让河道恢复使用，上级部门要求工程队 25 天内完成河道的全部清淤工作，那么工程队至少要有多少台挖沙机同时工作：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"4"},{"key":"B","text":"5"},{"key":"C","text":"6"},{"key":"D","text":"7"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"把新增淤泥看成白吃牛。白吃牛 = (1×300-2×100)/(300-100) = 0.5 台/天，表示每天新增淤泥需要 0.5 台挖沙机抵消。原有淤泥 = (2-0.5)×100 = 150。25 天内完成，干活牛需 150/25=6 台，再加 0.5 台白吃牛，共 6.5 台，至少取 7 台。","originalExampleFingerprint":"d82b1941","declaredOriginalSource":"2019 联考","answerSourceKeys":["[\"quantity\",\"cow-eating-grass\",\"真题示例\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-qu03-000091","questionRevision":2,"effectiveContentDigest":"e7ddfa44b9f985ba123434c52a98476c0c30c8c56c50a5207354ba04f607f357"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-qu03-000091","revision":2,"sha256":"d4ddfa339b5755c5a155189d35ea7c44b46170afdf2d29afcd2a8402140de4a2"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"cow-eating-grass","tabId":"真题示例","revision":null,"sha256":"1ccfb5edc9721bb463719d009b09ab47338b95418a9d47e92b03fe716b49be3f"},{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"cow-eating-grass","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"d6b310ff437bc88cb52b5f2b267a4da45d3135a208fa7db81364451aae80d7bc"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"cow-eating-grass","tabId":"真题示例","expectedBlockSha256":"0618ee0e88baeec5d0beb2374047a9d9b90db9667f3f9981f962b02c1d959645","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"e2e1cba4006fdac3f7da46af3d4ab716bc6ecc176a90899e66160dc21a1f66ec","ruleVersion":"exam-goal-v4","ruleDigest":"cde4b0cf5c8f1542a5a662cc642037c39b9968aba1618b319d56fd8b62cb8033","receiptId":"coverage-correct02-independent-notes-q-app-qu03-000091-r2","signatureVersion":"notes-semantic-v1","signature":"45a4b36c637da9954